[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0025","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0051","title":"IBM DB2 Universal Database 默认账户密码漏洞","description":"IBM DB2 Universal Database 6.1 在安装过程中会创建具有默认用户名和密码的数据库账户，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用这些已知的默认凭据直接登录数据库系统，获取数据的读取、修改权限，甚至执行任意 SQL 命令。该漏洞影响 IBM DB2 for Linux 6.1 及 Windows NT 6.1 版本，攻击者只需知道默认账户信息即可远程利用，无需特殊权限或用户交互，危害严重。官方建议在安装后立即修改默认账户密码或禁用默认账户。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0051"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33Z","remediation":"立即修改 IBM DB2 Universal Database 中所有默认账户的密码，删除或禁用不使用的默认账户。如无法修改密码，应升级至不再使用默认凭据的 DB2 版本（7.x 及以上），并在防火墙层面限制对数据库端口的未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/149222","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2068","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5662","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20472","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0051.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0051.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0051","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0051.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0051.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/afea9e4d3a1176ab218afc5d6d560a6f135838c1/2001/CVE-2001-0051.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0051.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0051.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0051.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0051.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0025.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0024","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0050","title":"BitchX IRC客户端DNS缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"BitchX IRC 客户端 1.0 c17 版本存在 DNS 缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送一个指向超长 DNS 主机名或域名的 IP 地址，当 BitchX 客户端解析该 DNS 响应时触发缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前已有公开的利用代码（ExploitDB ID: 20490）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0050"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33Z","remediation":"升级 BitchX IRC 客户端至 1.0c18 或更高版本。各发行版用户请安装对应补丁：FreeBSD 安装 FreeBSD-SA-00:78 安全公告中的更新；Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2000:126 提供的更新包；Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2000:079 更新。临时缓解措施：使用受信任的 DNS 服务器，避免连接不可信的 IRC 网络。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0081.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0086.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000364","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2000/MDKSA-2000-079.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-126.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2087","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5701","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20490","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0050.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0050","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0050.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0050.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0050.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2001/CVE-2001-0050.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0050.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0050.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0050.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0050.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0023","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0049","title":"WatchGuard SOHO Firewall 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WatchGuard SOHO Firewall 2.2.1 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标设备发送大量 HTTP GET 请求，耗尽设备处理资源，导致防火墙服务崩溃或无法响应正常流量。该漏洞利用门槛低，攻击者只需发送大量 GET 请求即可触发，影响设备可用性。Exploit-DB 上已有公开利用代码，攻击者可轻易实施拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0049"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33Z","remediation":"升级 WatchGuard SOHO Firewall 固件至 2.2.2 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可在防火墙管理界面配置 HTTP 连接数限制规则，对单条会话的并发 GET 请求数设置阈值（如每分钟不超过 30 个连接），并启用连接速率限制功能，以减缓大量 GET 请求对设备内存资源的耗尽，防止防火墙重启或完全停止服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0079.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2082","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5665","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20487","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0049.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0049.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0049","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0049.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0049.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0049.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2001/CVE-2001-0049.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0049.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0049.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0049.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0023.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0023.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0022","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0042","title":"Apache PHP 3 文件泄露漏洞","description":"PHP 3.x 运行于 Apache 1.3.6 时存在路径遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含 \"%5c\"（编码反斜杠）的变体 \"..\"（点号点号）序列，绕过 PHP 的文件路径校验机制，从而读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响运行 PHP 3.x 的 Apache 1.3.6 及可能受影响的早期版本，攻击者只需向目标 Web 服务器发送特制 HTTP 请求即可触发，无需事先认证。成功利用后，攻击者可窃取如 /etc/passwd、配置文件等敏感文件内容，进而为进一步渗透提供信息支撑。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0042"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:32Z","remediation":"立即将 PHP 3.x 升级至 PHP 4.0 或更高版本，PHP 3 已停止维护且该路径遍历漏洞在 PHP 4 中已修复；同时将 Apache 升级至 1.3.7 或更高版本以加强路径规范化处理。如暂时无法升级，可在 Apache 配置中使用 mod_rewrite 拦截包含 %5c 或连续点号的反斜杠编码请求，或禁用 .php3 等旧扩展名的解析。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/149210","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2060","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5659","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20466","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0042.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0042.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0042","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0042.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0042.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0042.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d5efef4fd74ef7181076173af290c3cdae5dbeb5/2001/CVE-2001-0042.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/79f011994331b34296ba6ea2a2efb2abebb8b5f6/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0042.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0042.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0042.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0021","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0041","title":"Cisco Catalyst 交换机 Telnet 认证内存泄露拒绝服务漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Cisco Catalyst 4000、5000 和 6000 系列交换机在 Telnet 认证过程中存在内存泄漏漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份验证，通过连续发送多次失败的 Telnet 认证尝试即可触发该漏洞，导致系统无法正确释放内存资源，使设备内存逐步耗尽。该漏洞影响运行 Cisco CatOS 5.5.4a 及以下版本的上述系列交换机。攻击者利用脚本或工具向目标 Telnet 端口发起大量认证失败请求，反复触发内存泄漏，最终导致设备拒绝服务，无法处理新的连接请求或正常运行。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0041"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:32Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco CatOS 至 5.5(5) 或更高版本以修复 Telnet 认证内存泄漏漏洞。如暂无法升级，应禁用 Telnet 服务并改用 SSH 进行远程管理，同时在交换机上配置访问控制列表（ACL）仅允许可信管理网段访问设备管理端口，以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/catalyst-memleak-pub.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/801","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2072","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5656","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20473","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0041.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0041.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0041","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0041.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0041.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0041.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0041.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/709d7a1077875b40fcef6c8e7b7d04e5c3506666/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0041.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0041.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f71e6da69aa54c2303f943ea4b05f52ce2f911ff/2001/CVE-2001-0041.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0020","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0040","title":"APC UPS apcupsd 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"APC UPS 守护进程 apcupsd 将其进程 ID 保存到一个全局可写的文件中，导致本地攻击者可以通过修改该 PID 文件中的进程 ID 值来终止任意进程，从而造成本地拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 apcupsd 3.7.2 版本的 APC UPS 设备及相关 Linux/UNIX 系统，攻击者只需具备本地系统访问权限即可利用，无需身份认证。通过向 apcupsd.pid 文件写入目标进程 ID，可导致受保护的服务或关键进程被意外终止，影响系统可用性。ExploitDB 上已有公开的利用代码（EDB-ID: 251），建议升级 apcupsd 至安全版本并限制 PID 文件的访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0040"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:32Z","remediation":"建议升级 apcupsd 至 3.8.0 或更高版本（官方已修复该 PID 文件权限问题）。若暂时无法升级，可将 apcupsd.pid 文件权限修改为 644（chmod 644 /var/run/apcupsd.pid）并确保以非 root 低权限用户运行守护进程，防止本地用户篡改 PID 导致拒绝服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0066.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-077.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2070","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5654","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/251","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0040.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0040.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0040","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0040.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0040.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f89e5c809343acea555b12ff38461dcb4bd93eb9/2001/CVE-2001-0040.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0040.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/22b1a4be43e1ee76195d2510f5edf079a15013bd/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0040.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0040.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0040.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0020.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0020.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0019","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0038","title":"MetaProducts Offline Explorer 1.x 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"MetaProducts Offline Explorer 1.4 之前版本（含 1.x 系列）存在文件系统信息泄露漏洞，由于程序在处理下载请求时未对 URL 中的驱动器标识符进行有效过滤，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在请求中指定目标系统驱动器盘符（如 C:），直接读取受感染主机上的目录结构及文件内容。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台下运行的所有受影响版本，攻击者仅需向默认监听端口 800 发起简单的 HTTP GET 请求即可触发，无需任何身份验证或交互，从而泄露敏感文件信息。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0038"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:32Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 MetaProducts Offline Explorer 至 1.4 Service Release 2 或更高版本，该版本已修复文件系统泄露漏洞。若暂时无法升级，请在 Web 服务器或防火墙层面配置规则拦截包含盘符路径（如 C:、D:）的异常 URL 请求，并限制应用程序对本地文件系统的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0078.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2084","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5728","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20488","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0038.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0038.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0038","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0038.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0038.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2001/CVE-2001-0038.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8520d937e15944966a691fee8c5449a66b3b22b2/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0038.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0038.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0038.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0038.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0019.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0019.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0018","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0037","title":"Keware Technologies HomeSeer 1.4 目录遍历漏洞","description":"HomeSeer 1.4.29 之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在 URL 中使用 ..（点号）路径穿越序列构造恶意请求，从而读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞利用门槛极低，攻击者无需持有任何凭据即可通过网络远程发起利用，可导致敏感配置文件、用户数据等机密信息泄露。受影响产品为 Keware Technologies 开发的 HomeSeer 家庭自动化服务器软件，攻击条件仅需目标系统对外开放相关 Web 服务端口，攻击者即可通过浏览器或脚本工具发送包含目录穿越路径的特制 HTTP 请求获取文件内容，造成信息泄露风险。建议用户升级至 1.4.29 或更高版本以修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0037"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:32Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 HomeSeer 至 1.4.29 或更高版本以彻底修复此目录遍历漏洞。如暂无法升级，可在 IIS/Apache 等前端 Web 服务器配置 URL 重写规则，拦截包含 '../' 或 URL 编码后的 '%2e%2e' 路径遍历字符的请求，同时限制 Web 服务进程对系统敏感目录（如 system32、etc）的读取权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0082.html","http://www.keware.com/hsbetachanges.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2085","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5663","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20489","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0037.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0037.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0037","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0037.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0037.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2001/CVE-2001-0037.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0037.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0037.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0037.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0037.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0017","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0034","title":"KTH Kerberos 4 任意代理使用权限提升漏洞","description":"KTH Kerberos IV 实现中存在任意代理使用漏洞，本地用户可通过设置 krb4_proxy 环境变量来指定一个非预期的替代代理服务器。攻击者可利用此机制生成伪造的 Kerberos 代理响应，从而绕过正常的身份验证流程并可能提升系统权限。该漏洞影响 KTH Kerberos 4 相关版本，攻击条件要求攻击者已具备目标系统的本地访问权限。由于漏洞利用仅需本地账户且无需复杂配置，潜在风险等级较高，可能导致攻击者获得系统范围内的完整控制权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0034"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:31Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 KTH Kerberos 4，迁移至 MIT Kerberos 5（最新版 1.21+）或 Heimdal Kerberos（最新版 7.8+）。若必须继续使用旧版本，需在所有 Kerberos 服务启动脚本中显式取消设置 krb4_proxy 环境变量（unset krb4_proxy），并在防火墙层面封锁非受信主机对 Kerberos 端口（88/tcp、88/udp、749/tcp、750/udp、464/tcp、464/udp）的访问。同时配置 telnet/SSH 等服务禁止接受客户端传递的环境变量（SSH 设置 PermitUserEnvironment no，telnetd 禁用 ENVIRON 选项）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0093.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0105.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5733","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20491","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0034.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0034.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0034","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0034.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0034.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0034.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2001/CVE-2001-0034.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0034.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0034.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0034.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0016","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0032","title":"ssldump 0.9 b1 远程格式字符串漏洞","description":"ssldump 0.9 b1 版本存在格式字符串漏洞，程序在处理用户提供的 URL 输入时未对格式字符串进行充分验证，攻击者可通过在 URL 中注入恶意的格式字符串说明符来操纵内存。该漏洞影响 ssldump 0.9 b1 版本，无需身份认证的远程攻击者即可利用，只需向目标系统发送包含特制格式字符串的 URL 即可触发。成功利用后可能导致应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务），并可能进一步获取 root 权限实现远程代码执行，危害程度极高。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0032"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:31Z","remediation":"立即将 ssldump 升级至 0.9b2 或更高版本，具体操作为：从官方源（https://github.com/stevemk14ebr/Pcap-Analyst 或原始项目 https://www.rtfm.com/ssldump/）下载修复后的源码包，执行 ./configure && make && make install 重新编译安装。若当前通过 Debian/Ubuntu 包管理安装，运行 apt-get update && apt-get install --only-upgrade ssldump 从发行版安全更新仓库获取补丁版本。作为临时缓解措施，在防火墙或 IDS 规则中对包含 %s、%n、%x 等格式字符串字符的 URL 进行过滤拦截，并移除 ssldump 的 setuid 位权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/ssldump），防止攻击者利用该漏洞以 root 权限执行任意代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/149917","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2096","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5717","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20492","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0032.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0032.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0032","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0032.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0032.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0032.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1df391c77d130b035c18b078a1d93cfdac5c26df/2001/CVE-2001-0032.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0032.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0032.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0032.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0016.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0008","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0021","title":"Endymion MailMan Webmail 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Endymion MailMan Webmail 是一款基于 Web 的电子邮件客户端软件，该软件在 3.0.25 及更早版本中存在严重的命令注入漏洞。攻击者可通过在 alternate_template 参数中插入 Shell 元字符，向目标服务器操作系统注入并执行任意系统命令。由于该漏洞位于 Web 前端接口，未经身份验证的远程攻击者无需任何凭据即可利用此漏洞，通过构造包含恶意 alternate_template 参数的 HTTP 请求即可触发，从而完全控制服务器、窃取敏感数据或进一步渗透内网。该漏洞影响所有使用 Endymion MailMan 3.0.x 至 3.0.25 版本的系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，用户应尽快升级到修复版本消除风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0021"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:30Z","remediation":"升级到 Endymion MailMan 4.0 或更高版本，其中修复了 alternate_template 参数的 shell 元字符处理漏洞；如无法立即升级，可通过配置文件禁用该功能或限制其访问以临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0057.html","http://www.endymion.com/products/mailman/history.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2063","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5649","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20469","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0021.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0021","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0021.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0021.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/092113bf9ab92144574ec15fc26608ac15913e5a/2001/CVE-2001-0021.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6450d916b228b26926c778e450e50985a2beb640/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0021.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0021.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0021.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0021.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0021.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0008.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0008.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0706","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0706.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0076","title":"Ikonboard register.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Ikonboard 2.1.7b 及更早版本中的 register.cgi 存在远程命令执行漏洞。攻击者可通过向 SEND_MAIL 参数传递特制数据，覆盖程序内部用于引用可执行程序的变量，从而在服务器上以 Web 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，可导致服务器完全失陷。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0076"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36Z","remediation":"Ikonboard 已停止维护，官方未发布补丁。建议立即迁移至仍受支持的论坛软件（如 phpBB、Simple Machines Forum 或 Discourse），迁移前导出数据库和配置文件。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器层面删除或重命名 register.cgi 文件，并限制 CGI 目录的执行权限（如 Apache 中 `Options -ExecCGI`），同时配置 WAF 规则拦截包含 SEND_MAIL 参数的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0483.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2157","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5819","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0076.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0076.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0076","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0076.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0076.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0076.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/83e06f4dc8d4c981660063007f8931d97353357a/2001/CVE-2001-0076.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0076.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0076.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0076.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0706.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0706.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0700","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0700.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0070","title":"1st Up Mail Server 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"1st Up Mail Server 4.1 的 MAIL FROM 命令处理存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标邮件服务器发送超长的 MAIL FROM 命令，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 1st Up Mail Server 4.1 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前官方已停止维护，建议用户迁移至其他受支持的邮件服务器软件。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0070"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:35Z","remediation":"该产品（1st Up Mail Server 4.1）已停止维护，厂商不再提供安全更新，建议立即迁移至受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Exchange Server、Postfix 等）。在迁移完成前，可在网络边界防火墙配置规则，仅允许受信任源 IP 访问 TCP 端口 25（SMTP），并部署 IPS/IDS 设备检测过长的 MAIL FROM 命令（正常 MAIL FROM 命令长度通常不超过 256 字节），对超过 512 字节的 SMTP 命令直接拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q4/0143.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2152","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5808","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0070.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0070.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0070","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0070.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0070.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0070.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c6500283f68defe11c86dcd41d1529288a6fc9b1/2001/CVE-2001-0070.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0070.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0070.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0070.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0700.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0686","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0065","title":"bftpd 1.0.13 SITE CHOWN 命令缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"bftpd 1.0.13 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务发送超长的 SITE CHOWN 命令触发该漏洞，导致目标服务崩溃（拒绝服务），并可能进一步利用该漏洞执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 bftpd 1.0.13 及更早版本，攻击无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议用户升级至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0065"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 bftpd 至 1.0.14 或更高版本（当前最新稳定版为 6.7），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。从 https://sourceforge.net/projects/bftpd/files/bftpd/ 下载新版源码编译安装。如无法升级，可在 ftp 配置文件中禁用 SITE CHOWN 命令，或在防火墙限制对 FTP 服务端口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0189.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5775","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0065.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0065.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0065","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0065.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0065.json","https://